1
00:00:22,806 --> 00:00:26,690
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,090 --> 00:00:33,705
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,578 --> 00:00:40,716
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,054 --> 00:00:47,063
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,274 --> 00:00:51,195
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,406 --> 00:00:54,497
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,794 --> 00:00:59,029
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,014 --> 00:01:03,922
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:07,106
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,416 --> 00:01:12,198
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,198 --> 00:01:16,778
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,778 --> 00:01:18,777
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:24,762
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,146 --> 00:01:29,457
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,457 --> 00:01:31,965
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,211 --> 00:01:42,428
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,878 --> 00:01:48,712
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,712 --> 00:01:51,630
=Episode 2=

19
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,200
We meet again.

20
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,640
How ridiculous!

21
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:03,719
What's so ridiculous?

22
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:06,439
Others force women into marriage,

23
00:02:06,439 --> 00:02:07,760
but you're forcing a man.

24
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:08,959
Isn't that ridiculous?

25
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:15,439
Love is a matter of mutual consent.

26
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:17,039
How can you make it like a deal?

27
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:19,319
Do you listen to yourself?

28
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:21,479
What do you mean?

29
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:25,520
Erya is the daughter of Wang family.

30
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:30,039
She's more than good enough
for a demon hunter like him.

31
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:33,360
The Wang family is surely cunning.

32
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:37,000
Look how frail Young Master Xu is.

33
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:41,159
Did your Wang family think
he's weak and easy to bully,

34
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:42,719
so you tried to force him into this?

35
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:45,120
Stop spouting nonsense!

36
00:02:45,879 --> 00:02:47,000
This Xu Xian

37
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:50,639
just beat up four of our servants.

38
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:52,599
You said he is weak?

39
00:02:53,039 --> 00:02:55,599
You said it yourself, four servants!

40
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,800
That proves you used your power

41
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,840
to force a man into marriage
with vile tactics.

42
00:03:01,439 --> 00:03:03,439
I... Nonsense!

43
00:03:03,680 --> 00:03:05,520
Vile tactics?

44
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,400
Xu Xian, who do you think you are?

45
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,039
Erya took a liking to you.

46
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:12,759
You should thank your luck.

47
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:14,360
Right, Erya?

48
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:17,879
Erya?

49
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:24,639
Erya!

50
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:27,039
Erya, what are you doing?

51
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:30,159
Well, actually,

52
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:33,759
it's not like
I have to marry Young Master Xu.

53
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:39,400
I think there are better men out there.

54
00:03:46,639 --> 00:03:48,560
Looks like I don't have that luck.

55
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:50,879
I have things to do, bye then.

56
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,159
Close the door when you leave.

57
00:03:54,639 --> 00:03:57,599
Xu Xian, you'll regret this.

58
00:03:59,479 --> 00:04:00,639
Erya, let's go.

59
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,800
Come on.

60
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,719
Suzhen.

61
00:04:13,159 --> 00:04:14,960
You insist on dressing like a man,

62
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:16,159
quite charming.

63
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,920
I just did you a big favor.

64
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,079
You'd better change back.

65
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:26,240
No, I'm here to help you
pass your love trial smoothly.

66
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,040
Stop it.

67
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:30,319
I'll go scout.

68
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:31,639
Wait at the usual spot.

69
00:04:55,168 --> 00:04:56,959
(Shanyao Village)

70
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:58,959
The village is filled with evil aura.

71
00:05:08,639 --> 00:05:10,639
Father! Mother!

72
00:05:12,399 --> 00:05:15,800
Y-You killed my parents!

73
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:22,879
White Snake, I'll kill you!

74
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,600
It's you.

75
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,240
Miss, why are you here?

76
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:44,000
It started raining after you left.

77
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:45,759
You didn't have an umbrella,

78
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,160
so I followed you.

79
00:05:47,439 --> 00:05:50,519
But then you suddenly seemed possessed,

80
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:51,560
shouting and screaming,

81
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:53,079
and even held a blade to my neck.

82
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:57,240
I was caught in an illusion,

83
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:59,360
relived my past,

84
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:00,720
and nearly hurt you.

85
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,120
I'm sorry.

86
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,800
But it's dangerous here.

87
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:05,560
Please leave, Miss.

88
00:06:07,439 --> 00:06:08,439
Are you worried about me?

89
00:06:08,759 --> 00:06:09,759
I'm worried you...

90
00:06:13,319 --> 00:06:14,360
You might get in my way.

91
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,600
(Fool.)

92
00:06:16,959 --> 00:06:18,040
Please leave, Miss.

93
00:06:18,639 --> 00:06:20,680
People here were bewitched
by an evil demon.

94
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:24,040
They sacrificed kindness to feed it
in hopes of immortality,

95
00:06:24,256 --> 00:06:26,112
which led to the village
being slaughtered.

96
00:06:26,800 --> 00:06:28,360
Resentment fills this area.

97
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:30,319
You shouldn't stay here.

98
00:06:31,759 --> 00:06:33,399
(Such minor demons could never harm me.)

99
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,600
Since it's so dangerous here,

100
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:41,639
shouldn't you walk me back?

101
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:47,439
Then I have no choice
but to force you out.

102
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,680
Watch out!

103
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,319
(Why is she so strong?)

104
00:07:03,879 --> 00:07:05,720
(Oh no, I overdid it.)

105
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:07,319
(What should I do?)

106
00:07:08,399 --> 00:07:10,439
Young Master Xu, save me!

107
00:08:03,199 --> 00:08:05,839
Young Master Xu, why are you doing this?

108
00:08:05,839 --> 00:08:07,600
Legend says the foul air of graveyards

109
00:08:07,959 --> 00:08:09,800
can turn into a Rakshasa Bird,

110
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:10,800
as big as a gray crane,

111
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,079
capable of shapeshifting,

112
00:08:12,319 --> 00:08:13,319
and feeds on human eyes.

113
00:08:13,959 --> 00:08:15,319
The Rakshasa Bird is vicious,

114
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:18,079
yet it seemed afraid of you.

115
00:08:20,439 --> 00:08:21,680
I have a special constitution.

116
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:24,240
Ordinary demons
can't come anywhere near me.

117
00:08:25,759 --> 00:08:27,199
So you...

118
00:08:28,879 --> 00:08:31,240
(Oh no, he figured it out.)

119
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,639
The pure yang constitution?

120
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:39,480
Exactly! You're so sharp,
Young Master Xu.

121
00:08:42,639 --> 00:08:44,759
Let's go then. I'll take you home.

122
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:59,399
Though I have the pure yang constitution

123
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,240
to ward off evil,

124
00:09:01,679 --> 00:09:05,840
I'm still a poor, homeless woman.

125
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,919
Young Master Xu, if you...

126
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:13,000
Hey! I haven't finished!

127
00:09:15,600 --> 00:09:18,159
Even though I have some family wealth,

128
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,960
I'm all alone.

129
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:22,919
I only have Qing to protect me.

130
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:26,879
My relatives are all vicious,

131
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:30,159
so the two of us just left
with our fortune.

132
00:09:30,159 --> 00:09:31,440
But far away from home...

133
00:09:34,879 --> 00:09:35,879
Miss,

134
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,159
I'm not someone you can rely on.

135
00:09:42,679 --> 00:09:45,399
(Why is this guy so stubborn?)

136
00:09:54,519 --> 00:09:56,000
(Why does he have my scale?)

137
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,720
It's been ten years.

138
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:04,200
You've finally appeared.

139
00:10:06,120 --> 00:10:08,159
I will track you down this time.

140
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,279
Who is it?

141
00:10:11,919 --> 00:10:13,360
The enemy

142
00:10:15,639 --> 00:10:17,039
who killed my parents.

143
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:22,639
(I killed his parents?)

144
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,200
(I see into your mind.)

145
00:10:34,919 --> 00:10:37,120
(You have a missing memory.)

146
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:42,919
When I was undergoing my tribulation,

147
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:44,919
I ran into that couple by chance.

148
00:10:45,639 --> 00:10:47,879
They seemed to be approaching me
to do something,

149
00:10:48,679 --> 00:10:51,000
and then I was in unbearable pain,

150
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:52,759
and lost my memory.

151
00:10:53,679 --> 00:10:54,679
Suzhen,

152
00:10:55,159 --> 00:10:56,279
don't worry.

153
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,480
With your kind heart,

154
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,080
you couldn't have killed those mortals.

155
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:03,159
Something unexpected must have happened

156
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,919
to cause their tragic deaths.

157
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:09,440
Goddess told you
to repay Xu Xian's favor,

158
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,759
so he must have been
the one who saved you.

159
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:15,519
Suzhen,

160
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:18,440
do you remember what happened
between you and Xu Xian?

161
00:11:25,559 --> 00:11:26,559
I can't remember clearly.

162
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:31,320
Suzhen, let's just be patient.

163
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,559
Don't rush it.

164
00:11:39,080 --> 00:11:40,559
Xu Xian is such a blockhead.

165
00:11:41,279 --> 00:11:42,600
To make him fall in love,

166
00:11:42,919 --> 00:11:46,000
who knows how long it'll take?

167
00:11:48,919 --> 00:11:51,919
Suzhen, you mentioned that day

168
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:53,759
that Xu Xian was injured
in Shanyao Village.

169
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:01,639
Qing, will this really work?

170
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,559
Just go do it.

171
00:12:04,440 --> 00:12:05,679
I'm sure you'll win him over.

172
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:09,000
Men are all the same.

173
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:11,480
Qing!

174
00:12:53,635 --> 00:12:57,794
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

175
00:13:00,261 --> 00:13:04,639
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

176
00:13:06,182 --> 00:13:12,007
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

177
00:13:12,776 --> 00:13:17,243
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

178
00:13:20,108 --> 00:13:24,549
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

179
00:13:26,745 --> 00:13:31,475
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

180
00:13:32,687 --> 00:13:38,800
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

181
00:13:39,463 --> 00:13:45,245
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

182
00:13:45,245 --> 00:13:51,508
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

183
00:13:51,818 --> 00:13:58,177
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

184
00:13:58,348 --> 00:14:05,715
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

185
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:11,547
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

186
00:14:12,038 --> 00:14:18,248
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

187
00:14:18,558 --> 00:14:25,331
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

188
00:14:26,328 --> 00:14:31,981
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

189
00:14:32,815 --> 00:14:37,223
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

190
00:14:37,988 --> 00:14:40,576
♪Having ever loved♪
